# Cloudflare R2 (large-artifact object storage) - environment template (RL-098)
#
# Copy the RELEVANT KEYS ONLY into the target environment's secret store.
# NEVER commit real values. Per-environment values MUST differ (separate
# bucket + scoped API token per environment).
#
# R2_ACCOUNT_ID: the 32-hex Cloudflare account id; the S3 endpoint derives
#   as https://<accountId>.r2.cloudflarestorage.com.
# R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID / R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY: an R2 API token with the
#   Object Read & Write permission SCOPED TO THE SINGLE BUCKET (spec:
#   "R2 uploads use scoped credentials" - deployment.md §7). Never an
#   account-wide token.
# R2_BUCKET: one bucket per environment (e.g. roamlink-<env>-artifacts).
# R2_ENDPOINT: optional override; leave empty for the derived endpoint.

R2_ACCOUNT_ID=
R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
R2_BUCKET=
R2_ENDPOINT=
